  m_Text: 'MOVE: left stick     TURN: right stick

    FIRE: hold the foregrip with
    LEFT grip, then RIGHT trigger.

    RELOAD (left hand):

    1. Release the foregrip.
    Grip the magazine and pull it out.

    2. Release grip to discard it. Old rounds
    are lost.

    3. Grip near your LEFT waist for a fresh 30-round magazine.

    4.
    Move it into the socket, then grip the foregrip again.

    HEALTH / WAVE / KILLS:
    look at your right forearm.

    PAUSE: X (left controller). Point at a button
    and select it.'
